% NOTE: PhysLean-coverage exemption (planner-recorded, iter-003): PhysLean has no classical-paramagnet thermodynamic-cycle module (Curie-style EOS `T*M*V = n*K*H`, adiabatic demagnetization calorimetry); nearest LeanExplore hits were generic MagneticField/Temperature fields (see task\_results/physics-grounding-IPhO2026Problems\_problem\_IPhO\_2026\_3\_C\_3.md). The Carnot-cycle-on-(M,H,T) model stays local over the `import Mathlib` baseline; no irrelevant Physlib import is added.
